  "discord": "The ARC Daily Digest · Early edition\nARC-2: guoqin gu reaches fifteenth as the provisional gold cutoff rises to 63.06. NguyenThanhNhan and Yanming (Owen) Dong make double-digit score advances into the top thirty. Tufa Labs leads an unchanged top-ten order.\nhttps://arc.markbarney.net/news/2026-10-19-morning-arc-2",
